  <questiondescription format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p id="concept">Area Approximations: mid-ordinate and trapezoidal estimates of a plot</p><p id="description">Grade 12 CBE Core 2.2 (c, d) / Essential 2.1 (c, d): Choose the right widths from one survey table for the mid-ordinate rule and for the trapezoidal rule, and compare the two estimates of a plot's value in Ksh.</p><p id="edition">Core and Essential</p><p id="provenance">This question is original to this project.</p><p id="citation">INNODEMS CBC Grade 12 Mathematics, first draft by Ben Davies, 2026. Aligned to the KICD Senior School Curriculum Design, Core and Essential Mathematics Grade 12 (draft).</p>]]></text></questiondescription>
